.TH sway-things-notifications 1 "" "Sway Things 0.4.0" "Sway Things Manual"
.SH NAME
sway\-things\-notifications \- Do Not Disturb, the notification daemon that runs, and a test notification
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsway\-things notifications\fR [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Do Not Disturb, the notification daemon that runs, and a test notification
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<WHEN>\fR [default: auto]
Controls when to use color
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
auto
.IP \(bu 2
always
.IP \(bu 2
never
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
sway\-things\-notifications\-dnd(1)
Show whether Do Not Disturb is on, or switch it: for mako, swaync and dunst
.TP
sway\-things\-notifications\-status(1)
Show which notification daemon runs and whether Do Not Disturb is on
.TP
sway\-things\-notifications\-test(1)
Send a test notification through the daemon that runs
.TP
sway\-things\-notifications\-import\-swaync(1)
